#: forum/templates/add_forum_post.html:6
msgid ""
"Erstelle einen neuen Post im Forum von ClimateQuest, um deine Fragen zur "
"Klimakrise oder zur Organisation und Durchführung von Aktionen zum Klima-"
"Themen von anderen Usern beantworten zu lassen."
msgstr ""
"Create a new post in the ClimateQuest forum to have your questions about the "
"climate crisis or the organization and implementation of climate-themed "
"actions answered by other users."

#: forum/templates/add_forum_post.html:9
msgid "Forum-Beitrag hinzufügen"
msgstr "Add forum post"

#: forum/templates/add_forum_post.html:13
#: forum/templates/forum_overview.html:20
msgid "Beitrag hinzufügen"
msgstr "Add post"

#: forum/templates/add_forum_post.html:23
#: forum/templates/add_forum_post.html:24
#: forum/templates/forum_overview.html:33
msgid "Titel"
msgstr "Title"

#: forum/templates/add_forum_post.html:26
msgid "Inhalt"
msgstr "Content"

#: forum/templates/add_forum_post.html:30
msgid "Kategorie"
msgstr "Category"

#: forum/templates/add_forum_post.html:40
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Ich bestätige, dass dies eine ernst gemeinte Frage ist und dass sie mit den "
"<a href=\"%(url)s\">Nutzungsbedingungen</a> übereinstimmt."
msgstr ""
"I confirm that this is a serious question and that it complies with the <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">Terms of Use</a>."

#: forum/templates/add_forum_post.html:43
msgid "Speichern"
msgstr "Save"

#: forum/templates/forum_detail.html:6
msgid ""
"Sieh dir den Post im Forum von ClimateQuest an und lies die Antworten "
"anderer User zu diesem Thema. Antworte selbst auf den Post, um dein Wissen "
"zu teilen."
msgstr ""
"View the post in the ClimateQuest forum and read the answers from other "
"users on this topic. Answer the post yourself to share your knowledge."

#: forum/templates/forum_detail.html:9
#, python-format
msgid "Post %(title)s"
msgstr "Post %(title)s"

#: forum/templates/forum_detail.html:30
#, python-format
msgid "<a href=\"%(url)s\">Post</a> <i>%(title)s</i>"
msgstr "<a href=\"%(url)s\">Post</a> <i>%(title)s</i>"

#: forum/templates/forum_detail.html:42
#, python-format
msgid "Erstellt von <a href=\"%(url)s\">%(creator)s</a>"
msgstr "Created by <a href=\"%(url)s\">%(creator)s</a>"

#: forum/templates/forum_detail.html:43
#, python-format
msgid "Erstellt am: %(date)s"
msgstr "Created on: %(date)s"

#: forum/templates/forum_detail.html:44
#, python-format
msgid "Kategorie: %(category)s"
msgstr "Category: %(category)s"

#: forum/templates/forum_detail.html:49
#, python-format
msgid "Antwort von <a href=\"%(url)s\">%(creator)s</a> am %(date)s"
msgstr "Answer by <a href=\"%(url)s\">%(creator)s</a> on %(date)s"

#: forum/templates/forum_detail.html:54 forum/templates/forum_detail.html:66
msgid "Antworten"
msgstr "Answers"

#: forum/templates/forum_detail.html:63
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Ich bestätige, dass dies meines Wissens die Wahrheit und dass es mit den <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">Nutzungsbedingungen</a> übereinstimmt."
msgstr ""
"I confirm that this is the truth to my knowledge and that it complies with "
"the <a href=\"%(url)s\">Terms of Use</a>."

#: forum/templates/forum_overview.html:6
msgid ""
"Sieh dir die Übersicht aller Posts im Forum von ClimateQuest an. Finde "
"Antworten zu deinen Fragen zur Klimakrise oder zur Organisation und "
"Durchführung von Aktionen zum Klima-Themen."
msgstr ""
"View the overview of all posts in the ClimateQuest forum. Find answers to "
"your questions about the climate crisis or the organization and "
"implementation of climate-themed actions."

